      "content": "Answer the following question with a single MySQL SQL query against the current database. Explore the semantic network and verify with mysql_query as needed. The SELECT list must contain exactly the columns the question asks for, in the asked order. When the final SQL is verified, call the submit_SQL tool with it.\n\nThe following hints are provided to help you write the SQL:\n\n## Gold Tables\n- FCLT_ROOMS\n- FCLT_BUILDING_HIST\n- FCLT_BUILDING\n\n## Column Mapping\n- academic building: FCLT_BUILDING.BUILDING_TYPE\n- owned by MIT: FCLT_BUILDING.OWNERSHIP_TYPE, FCLT_BUILDING.SITE\n- total area of rooms: FCLT_ROOMS.AREA\n- rooms used for \"RESIDENT\" or \"LABS\" purposes: FCLT_ROOMS.MAJOR_USE_DESC\n- building name: FCLT_BUILDING.BUILDING_NAME\n- fiscal period: FCLT_BUILDING_HIST.FISCAL_PERIOD\n- running sum of assignable area within each campus sector: FCLT_BUILDING_HIST.ASSIGNABLE_AREA, FCLT_BUILDING.CAMPUS_SECTOR\n- building's external gross area: FCLT_BUILDING.EXT_GROSS_AREA\n- not the Stata building: FCLT_BUILDING.FCLT_BUILDING_KEY\n- order by fiscal period and building name: FCLT_BUILDING_HIST.FISCAL_PERIOD, FCLT_BUILDING.BUILDING_NAME\n\n## Join Keys\n- FCLT_BUILDING_HIST.FCLT_BUILDING_KEY <-> FCLT_ROOMS.FCLT_BUILDING_KEY\n- FCLT_BUILDING.FCLT_BUILDING_KEY <-> FCLT_BUILDING_HIST.FCLT_BUILDING_KEY\n\n## Question\nFor each academic building at MIT that is owned by MIT and has a total area of rooms used for \"RESIDENT\" or \"LABS\" purposes greater than 1000, provide the building name, the fiscal period, the total area of such rooms, the running sum of assignable area within each campus sector, and the building's external gross area. Only include buildings that are not the Stata building. Order the results by fiscal period and building name. Do not return any rounded answers."
